<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN"
        "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"/>
</head>
<body><p>Dear $recipientName,</p>

<p>Please be informed that $userName <div style="color: #979696; font: 10px Arial,sans-serif; text-decoration: line-through;">$oldTaskName</div> updated $taskName task on $date.</p>

<p>Task details are below:</p>

<p>Description: $description <div style="color: #979696; font: 10px Arial,sans-serif; text-decoration: line-through;">$oldTaskDescription</div> <br/>
    Start Date: $startdate <div style="color: #979696; font: 10px Arial,sans-serif; text-decoration: line-through;">$oldTaskStartDate</div> <br/>
    Due Date: $duedate <div style="color: #979696; font: 10px Arial,sans-serif; text-decoration: line-through;">$oldTaskDueDate</div> <br/>
    Assignee(s): $assignees <br/>
</p>

<p>Click <a href="$host/ProjectManagement.html?link=$link" title="View task">here</a> to view the task</p>

<p>* If you are not able to click on the link, you can instead copy and paste the following address in to your web
    browser: </p>

<p><span style="color: #0033FF">$host/ProjectManagement.html?link=$link</span></p>
</body>
</html>
